## Why This Is Asked
Tests end-to-end design of a real-time telemetry pipeline using Event Hubs, Functions, Cosmos TTL, multi-region DR, API surface via API Management, Front Door TLS, Entra ID, and GitHub Actions. Includes cost governance and cross-region considerations.

## Key Concepts
- Event streaming and serverless data path
- Cosmos DB TTL and multi-region replication
- API surface via API Management with Front Door TLS
- Identity with Entra ID and Static Web Apps
- GitHub Actions CI/CD with staging/prod
- Governance via tagging and budgets

